  "slug": "pxmppwuzowi",
  "title": "进阶记录",
  "html": "<p class=\"ws-p\">武神2武帝嗑药记录</p><p class=\"ws-p\">技能准备</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/FVZUb48inovty1xPMVscgDmDnde.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"864\" height=\"432\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">橙色绝门棍，需要10本武道书，190绝门残页进阶4次</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/HfTebYwp1oa8nXx2tv6cE9Gfn3f.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"865\" height=\"455\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">橙色云龙心法，需要10本武道书，190云龙残页进阶4次</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/FoiebsACto07L8xQXMDcSmLAneh.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"865\" height=\"468\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">悟性金顶绵掌，需要56本武道书</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/SYn0bw0laoQS1MxfFzYcU2XGnzf.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"755\" height=\"1078\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">无悟性金顶绵掌，需要52本武道书</p><p class=\"ws-p\">放弃所有绿色、蓝色技能、准备嗑药</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/PlCSb9AWDod9Zvx0DYHcKIOIn4b.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"865\" height=\"395\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/FTkWbFZLSoH8adxOu2Cc9jwonod.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"865\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/TaI9bu67loiIUgxN6QIcfy2unth.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"830\" height=\"431\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">绿色606，蓝色 400，黄色16，紫色 30</p><p class=\"ws-p\">嗑药至结束</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/Y6bZbe9WdowTCCxyX4Ic2BGVn8Y.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"865\" height=\"268\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/NSnHbjOXRogxEax6e2OcG80UnFf.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"865\" height=\"456\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">共消耗绿色606 蓝色313，共919，每级消耗突破丹5.743，</p><p class=\"ws-p\">相比武神1的300级1929个，每级消耗突破丹6.43，运气极大提升。</p><p class=\"ws-p\">吸珠子注意不及时点击献祭内力会吸收失败，有可能触发触发BUG不能继续吸，要找客服解决。</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/YSXGbkrlUoCOVXxbqS8crtlsnGV.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"565\" height=\"75\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-source\">内容整理自飞书《武神MUD2手册》· <a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/XmpPwUzoWiWo4rkOau6cbCNvnWh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看原文</a></p>",
  "source": "https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/XmpPwUzoWiWo4rkOau6cbCNvnWh"
}